WEBVTT

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.450
A girl shouldn't have scars on her body.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.250
Don't worry about me

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.550
I'll take care of myself

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:21.760
I burned everything

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:23.420
Nothing will lead to you anymore

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:24.390
Did you really kill everyone?

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:25.460
You're like an animal

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:26.960
You probably won't be forgiven

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:27.890
But I understand you

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:31.470
You are very unhappy... I think I understand you

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:32.230
She's mine

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:33.730
What did you just say?

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:34.680
This girl

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:35.700
belongs to me

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.460
I came to say that you seem to have made a mistake

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:38.390
Nothing here

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:39.760
doesn't belong to you

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:40.710
I promise you

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:43.960
No one will dare treat you like this again.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:45.980
Don't say anymore that I "belong" to you

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:46.980
Then...

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.520
Should I call you "my man"?

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:52.760
I can't even control my feelings

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:55.020
No matter how hard I try to change my direction...

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.160
it doesn't work

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:04.160
Episode 5

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:26.160
Project coordinator and song translator: Nemie

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:36.360
Translators: Nemie, Kaia

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:46.560
Beta Editor: Sana

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:56.760
Typesetters: Nemie, Sana

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:00.550
Why here?

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:04.610
The princes' chambers are luxurious and clean

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:07.160
Why did you want to live here?

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:13.640
This is where I spend my time, this is my place!

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:17.220
This is the emperor's palace

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:19.530
Are you saying something here belongs to you?

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.160
That's not what I meant

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:23.220
Well that's good

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:26.190
Invading someone else's home is wrong

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:28.620
Is everything allowed for the prince? A?

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:32.300
You can't see the sky from my chambers

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:39.770
I can't look at the stars that rise only above Goryeo

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:41.580
Only over Koryo?

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:44.070
Is this possible?

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.980
Mung beans, mulberries, bletilla, buttercups!

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:04.700
Trichosanth roots, spikenard, galangal, bison, incense

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:06.760
Wow, look!

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:09.940
This was sent by the 8th Prince

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:11.580
Prince?

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:14.260
You were looking for something to do

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.710
He said you like medicinal herbs

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:24.140
But... what do you want to do with all this?

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:27.280
Soap for washing.
I'll make soap for you

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:34.750
I'm standing in front of you again, standing here alone

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:37.920
Tell me with your lips

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:40.460
Only "yes", only "yes"

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:45.030
I don’t understand why, but I always rush to you

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:51.330
With the wind blowing I will tell you: I love

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:58.570
Do you think the Queen will like these soaps, as your sister said?

00:03:58.570 --> 00:03:59.710
Of course

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:02.630
There's not a person in Goryeo who doesn't like them

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:35.370
I'm standing in front of you again, standing here alone

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:35.740
Need to round up

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:38.570
Tell me with your lips

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:41.210
Only "yes", only "yes"

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:45.740
I don’t understand why, but I always rush to you

00:04:45.740 --> 00:04:51.840
With the wind blowing I will tell you: I love

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:57.020
Need you!

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:03.190
My dear, so to speak I want

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:05.630
What I can’t say

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:11.720
My dear, my dear, my dear: I love you!

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:17.220
Looks funny

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:18.830
Let's do it again

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:25.600
I've never seen her so happy

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:29.780
She was inspired by the idea to make it for her mother-in-law

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:33.740
Maybe she didn't say

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:36.180
but she's sad because she lost her memory

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:39.820
However, she still remembers how it's done

00:05:41.350 --> 00:05:42.580
This makes me happy

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:48.730
Su has become more mature after her injury

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:51.670
Often says wise things

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:54.710
but sometimes he acts his age, it's very cute

00:05:56.470 --> 00:06:00.470
Many times I thought about sending her home

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:04.670
Now I'm glad I didn't do it

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:12.440
I want to find her a suitable match,

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:23.790
so that she can be with us for a long time

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:27.410
I want to see her smile

00:06:32.130 --> 00:06:33.270
Yes

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:38.250
I feel the same

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:51.930
More...

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:19.940
I need to write a letter, can you provide me with a pen and ink?

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:22.930
Come to the library as soon as you finish your meal.

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:35.940
Sister, I'm here

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:53.490
Sister asked me to bring pen and ink

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:00.650
My wife's cough got worse, so she went to bed

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:04.400
She asked me to write this on her behalf

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:06.900
Oh yes...

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:26.140
Ink...

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:28.700
are lying here

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:29.760
Okay

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:29.840
This is Tao Yuanming's poem "Coming Home"

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:33.500
- You read it, right?
- Yes, yes... Yes...

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:41.950
When the lady writes a letter, she also writes a poem

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:55.900
What about you?

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.540
What?

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:02.480
Do you like poems or songs?

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:05.990
Poems... or songs?

00:10:06.490 --> 00:10:08.090
Songs, of course

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:11.040
Really?

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.420
Unexpectedly

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.530
A noble lady loves common people's songs

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:19.610
What? Is he talking about the wrong songs?

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:22.630
Oh, he was talking about music in Koryo, stupid

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:26.840
No, no, I also love poetry more than songs

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:48.300
Then I'll give you this poem

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:58.610
I think I want to give it to you

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:08.400
Read it carefully

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:10.960
Thank you

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:43.610
- Chae Ryong!
- Yes, madam

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:44.820
Come here

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:49.990
This is what they gave me here

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:54.470
This...

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:59.310
I forgot how to read when I hit my head

00:11:59.310 --> 00:12:00.350
What?

00:12:00.770 --> 00:12:04.190
I'll learn again, but in the meantime, could you read this?

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:06.920
How do I know how to read?

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.730
I only know how to read my name

00:12:11.550 --> 00:12:12.910
Sorry

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:34.500
Yang... Yang, Ryu, Chun, Chun, Kan, Su, Pyon!

00:12:35.590 --> 00:12:39.070
I can only understand each hieroglyph individually,

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:41.830
but together it turns out to be bullshit

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:47.730
I'm illiterate, how can I live here?

00:12:56.870 --> 00:13:00.750
His handwriting is as beautiful as he is

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.770
It would be great if I understood what was written

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:09.430
I want to read

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:15.350
I want to read, I want to read, I want to read

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:17.630
Why didn't I take Chinese lessons?

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:18.900
What are you doing?

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:22.400
- Lord
-Are you illiterate?

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:26.750
No

00:13:27.980 --> 00:13:29.770
I can read

00:13:29.770 --> 00:13:34.500
but I forgot everything when I hit my head

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:38.010
- Give it to me
- No, it's not worth it

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.120
Come on, I say!

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:41.580
Let's see

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:46.440
"The willows are green, the river water is calm,"

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:48.080
"I hear you, honey..."

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:53.560
You...

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:57.480
"The sun is peeking from the east, rain is coming from the west,"

00:13:58.320 --> 00:14:03.420
"In words there is bad weather - and yet it is clear"

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:06.870
Beautiful poem

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:10.750
This is Liu Yuxi's poem "Bamboo Shoots"

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:14.640
Do you know its meaning?

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:19.820
"The willows are green, the river water is calm"

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:24.560
It's about a beautiful landscape, right?

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:28.700
It could not have been written by an illiterate person

00:14:30.310 --> 00:14:31.490
Who gave it to you?

00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:34.230
The 8th prince gave it for study

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:44.100
Is it true that you can't read?

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:45.650
Aren't you pretending?

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:49.740
No. Why would I pretend to be stupid?

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:55.200
The prince gave you a good poem, don't forget to thank him

00:14:56.730 --> 00:15:00.830
Today you will have to greet the empress in the palace, get ready

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:03.530
In the palace? Will I go to the palace?!

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:06.820
Yes, you will give her the soap you made

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:11.090
Okay! Then I'll get ready!

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:19.980
Is my brother out of his mind?

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:23.450
This is an ordinary poem about a landscape

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:25.430
This is a poem about love

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:30.140
The last line implies “love”, this is a confession!

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:32.150
Are you telling me you don't know this?!

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:34.130
When you got married, I...

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:47.890
Really...

00:15:51.980 --> 00:15:53.790
Did you already know everything?

00:15:55.920 --> 00:16:00.800
Knew how Uk felt

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:03.580
Right?

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:05.410
Back A

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:16.000
Finish your drawing for me by the end of today

00:16:16.510 --> 00:16:17.870
Sister...

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:30.360
This means the willow is green and the water is calm

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:33.460
Darling sings on the river

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:40.500
The sun is peeking out from the east...

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:43.020
And what is this?

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:52.630
No! No no

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:57.480
What other meaning could there be?

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:09.490
He's gone!

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:13.490
Stop thinking like that already

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:17.210
the prince is just... Yes, who is he?.. A landlord!

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:19.880
Think of it as a homeowner.

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:27.130
You need to control your heart

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:30.880
My heart, my

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:38.910
Homeowner, homeowner...

00:18:23.130 --> 00:18:25.680
You have never come to Damiwon Palace

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:27.640
What brought you here?

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:32.020
Uk wanted to come with his wife and her cousin

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:34.200
My daughter-in-law is not well

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:36.800
I wanted to take some medicine from concubine O

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:40.470
I don't know why everyone trusts her so much

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:43.050
She is not a doctor, but a court lady

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:47.780
By the way, Prince Jeong has grown up a bit

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:50.630
I heard he has a private teacher?

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:53.640
The teacher is already approaching 70

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:57.050
He needs a teacher who will teach him not only life experience

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:02.100
Who taught Uka?

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:05.270
Uk picked up books every now and then

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:08.930
If something was unclear, I discussed it with the teacher

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:13.130
He abandoned his teacher early

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:15.470
Keep your teacher's name a secret?

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:19.000
Are you that worried about his little brother?

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:23.470
The 8th Prince has arrived

00:19:39.930 --> 00:19:41.780
Greetings, your highnesses

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.510
Nice to meet you

00:19:46.510 --> 00:19:48.340
Are you Hae Soo?

00:19:48.340 --> 00:19:51.180
First time I see you up close

00:19:51.180 --> 00:19:53.380
Of course very beautiful

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:56.410
Nice to meet you, Queen Hwangbo

00:19:57.270 --> 00:20:00.300
This is my sister-in-law's sixth cousin

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:01.610
Yes...

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:08.900
Oh, it’s about you, apparently, Jeong told me

00:20:08.900 --> 00:20:11.510
The girl who hit the 10th prince?

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:15.850
I've heard a lot about your deeds

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:19.340
They say you get along with my sons

00:20:21.940 --> 00:20:24.640
Nice to meet you, Empress

00:20:26.570 --> 00:20:29.830
Su gave you a gift

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:48.670
Oh my God! What a beauty

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:50.560
I've never seen anything like it

00:20:52.090 --> 00:20:53.890
If you use it when washing your face,

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:57.480
your skin will become very... soft

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:10.430
Thank you, I will

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:16.460
We have prepared a gift for you too, Empress

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:18.850
And for me?

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:26.760
I know you are a fragrance connoisseur.

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:28.100
Accept it

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:37.620
You have a very good daughter-in-law, queen

00:21:38.120 --> 00:21:39.910
It's a pity you don't have children

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:42.010
Then I would be perfect

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:49.560
They say great blessings don't come easy

00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:52.050
Thanks for your concern

00:21:54.670 --> 00:21:56.480
The Emperor has arrived!

00:22:00.930 --> 00:22:02.480
This is Emperor Taejo, Wang Gon!

00:22:02.480 --> 00:22:04.350
The founder of Koryo is Taejo!

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:07.630
I only saw him in dramas, but now I see him live

00:22:08.100 --> 00:22:09.420
Holy shit

00:22:11.440 --> 00:22:12.980
Have you arrived?

00:22:13.450 --> 00:22:15.340
Looks like you had a nice conversation here

00:22:18.550 --> 00:22:21.160
I heard that you are unwell

00:22:21.160 --> 00:22:24.230
It seems that thanks to your care I will get better soon

00:22:30.820 --> 00:22:34.810
Isn't this the girl who fought with Eun?

00:22:39.230 --> 00:22:41.080
They were just playing

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:43.650
The game mutilated the prince's face

00:22:43.650 --> 00:22:45.660
She's gone too far

00:22:47.150 --> 00:22:51.290
How could this cute girl fight with Eun?

00:22:51.290 --> 00:22:53.020
I deserve to die!

00:22:59.660 --> 00:23:01.260
Are you afraid of the emperor?

00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:05.950
Come to your senses

00:23:05.950 --> 00:23:07.620
The tyrant lives on fear

00:23:07.620 --> 00:23:09.620
and a wise ruler lives by virtue

00:23:13.480 --> 00:23:18.010
You are a good and wise emperor, I am not afraid of you

00:23:20.910 --> 00:23:22.540
Wise?

00:23:23.440 --> 00:23:26.080
Why do you think I'm wise?

00:23:39.290 --> 00:23:42.450
Do you want to get away from the topic with flattery?

00:23:44.490 --> 00:23:46.710
Please, please, please, please!

00:23:46.710 --> 00:23:48.820
Think, come up with something

00:23:52.900 --> 00:23:53.920
Well...

00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:57.940
You united three lands and founded a new country

00:24:00.900 --> 00:24:05.200
You did not humiliate people from other lands, but appointed them to high positions

00:24:05.550 --> 00:24:09.370
And more... more... what else?

00:24:11.330 --> 00:24:12.740
Parhae, Parhae!

00:24:12.740 --> 00:24:15.170
Parhe disappeared, but you remained faithful!

00:24:15.170 --> 00:24:17.120
Therefore you are a wise ruler

00:24:36.180 --> 00:24:38.720
She's very smart

00:24:39.620 --> 00:24:41.670
My high school history teacher...

00:24:41.700 --> 00:24:44.260
Sorry for cursing you when you asked me to remember this

00:24:44.260 --> 00:24:46.410
Thank you, may the Lord bless you!

00:24:46.410 --> 00:24:49.490
I guess you can do more than just fight

00:24:51.430 --> 00:24:55.240
Reward her with a precious carpet

00:24:55.240 --> 00:24:57.050
Yes, Your Majesty

00:24:57.050 --> 00:24:59.070
Precious, Your Majesty?

00:24:59.070 --> 00:25:01.250
What an honor for her!

00:25:08.710 --> 00:25:11.640
Su, I need to thank you

00:25:15.060 --> 00:25:18.180
Your generosity is limitless, Your Majesty!

00:25:31.210 --> 00:25:33.200
Damn, where is the restroom?

00:25:34.670 --> 00:25:38.340
I got nervous, my stomach hurts now

00:25:38.340 --> 00:25:40.420
Where's the restroom?

00:25:42.780 --> 00:25:45.020
Where? Where?

00:26:07.610 --> 00:26:08.870
God

00:26:15.660 --> 00:26:19.190
What are you doing here? This is no place for you

00:26:19.830 --> 00:26:22.270
Became a completely different person

00:26:23.870 --> 00:26:25.830
Now they will know that you are a prince

00:26:25.830 --> 00:26:28.540
I was born him, a prince since childhood

00:26:29.820 --> 00:26:30.980
What about you?

00:26:33.040 --> 00:26:35.060
Came to spy on men?

00:26:35.630 --> 00:26:37.110
I brought a gift to the Empress,

00:26:37.110 --> 00:26:40.510
and the 8th prince allowed me to walk around the palace

00:26:43.740 --> 00:26:46.040
Are you doing well here?

00:26:46.040 --> 00:26:47.590
Of course

00:26:47.590 --> 00:26:51.320
Like you said, this is my home, where my mother and brothers and sisters live.

00:26:51.320 --> 00:26:52.940
Oh yes...

00:26:52.940 --> 00:26:55.670
Too big for home

00:26:55.670 --> 00:26:58.240
Do you go to see your parents every day?

00:27:18.240 --> 00:27:21.480
I stayed here as I wanted.
Do you think you'll get what you want?

00:27:23.490 --> 00:27:26.720
I sent you to that family as a gesture of goodwill.

00:27:26.720 --> 00:27:27.930
And you didn't stay there

00:27:28.920 --> 00:27:30.240
Useless

00:27:30.240 --> 00:27:32.920
Born the same year, but you can’t hold a candle to Uku!

00:27:36.080 --> 00:27:38.300
Your only skill is killing people

00:27:38.300 --> 00:27:39.740
You don't know anything

00:27:39.740 --> 00:27:42.150
How are you going to stay in the palace?

00:27:44.850 --> 00:27:46.850
Thanks for your concern

00:27:48.160 --> 00:27:50.470
I won't burden you

00:27:50.470 --> 00:27:54.170
I use my only skill to avoid becoming a burden.

00:28:24.890 --> 00:28:26.560
Is she really his mother?

00:28:28.490 --> 00:28:31.100
Things are too terrible to witness.

00:28:34.110 --> 00:28:36.310
Should I have told him I was leaving?

00:28:43.250 --> 00:28:46.940
What has become more important than your health since you came?

00:28:52.560 --> 00:28:54.060
Is there anyone here?!

00:28:54.060 --> 00:28:56.170
Call a doctor immediately!

00:28:57.920 --> 00:29:00.200
I need to tell you something

00:29:00.640 --> 00:29:02.190
Child

00:29:02.190 --> 00:29:04.330
You told me on your wedding day

00:29:04.330 --> 00:29:06.960
They said I was the prince's source of strength

00:29:06.960 --> 00:29:10.500
They said that you would fulfill one of my requests later.

00:29:12.650 --> 00:29:18.120
Whatever it is, you promised that you would fulfill it

00:29:21.970 --> 00:29:25.230
Child, what can I do for you?

00:29:31.530 --> 00:29:32.650
Hae Soo...

00:29:35.380 --> 00:29:37.430
Please accept her as the prince's wife

00:29:42.720 --> 00:29:44.470
you know

00:29:47.590 --> 00:29:50.700
I don't have many days left

00:30:10.510 --> 00:30:12.520
Prince, have you come?

00:30:14.110 --> 00:30:16.570
Chi Mon, I came to visit my mother

00:30:16.570 --> 00:30:19.430
Uncle! You know me, right?

00:30:19.430 --> 00:30:20.740
What?

00:30:20.740 --> 00:30:22.290
We've met before

00:30:22.290 --> 00:30:24.650
We... even drank together

00:30:25.500 --> 00:30:28.350
What an outrageous story?

00:30:30.950 --> 00:30:35.130
Soo, have you met astronomer Choi Chi Mon before?

00:30:35.130 --> 00:30:37.150
Certainly!

00:30:41.310 --> 00:30:43.780
Uncle, you really don’t know me?

00:30:44.960 --> 00:30:47.810
I've been looking for you everywhere

00:30:48.240 --> 00:30:51.370
But I don't know you, lady

00:30:51.370 --> 00:30:54.620
I just recently found out that you are the cousin of the 8th Prince's wife

00:30:54.620 --> 00:30:56.760
I didn't look like that back then

00:30:56.760 --> 00:30:57.780
This was not in Goryeo

00:30:57.780 --> 00:31:00.670
It was... like a thousand years in the future!

00:31:00.670 --> 00:31:03.120
A thousand years later, in a park near a lake

00:31:03.120 --> 00:31:04.500
Be careful

00:31:04.500 --> 00:31:05.700
What?

00:31:06.960 --> 00:31:08.360
Inside the palace

00:31:11.490 --> 00:31:14.660
you must watch your every word

00:31:14.660 --> 00:31:17.800
Various conversations in the palace can be dangerous

00:31:17.800 --> 00:31:20.840
Especially conversations about the throne or the imperial family

00:31:20.840 --> 00:31:24.660
If you have to stay here, you should know about the rules of life in the palace

00:31:24.660 --> 00:31:29.390
Life cannot be changed by your own will

00:31:29.390 --> 00:31:32.750
Life cannot be changed by your own will

00:32:58.870 --> 00:33:03.180
So you and Choi Chi Mon knew each other before?

00:33:05.580 --> 00:33:08.670
I thought I knew him, but I was wrong

00:33:10.130 --> 00:33:11.280
Okay

00:33:12.630 --> 00:33:13.690
Wait

00:33:30.960 --> 00:33:35.670
I made this for you when I made soap for the Empress and Queen.

00:33:37.990 --> 00:33:40.080
I have a lot to thank you for

00:33:40.680 --> 00:33:43.510
Oh, and thank you for the poem

00:33:53.890 --> 00:33:54.960
Thank you

00:34:01.660 --> 00:34:05.600
So do you know what the poem is about?

00:34:06.930 --> 00:34:08.280
Of course

00:34:10.210 --> 00:34:12.750
It's about a green willow that grows near the water.

00:34:12.750 --> 00:34:15.490
And about a happy singing man

00:34:16.110 --> 00:34:18.930
Wonderful poem

00:34:22.710 --> 00:34:26.590
Then you should write back to me

00:34:27.710 --> 00:34:28.750
What?

00:34:29.180 --> 00:34:31.880
According to the rules of etiquette, one is supposed to respond verse to verse

00:34:33.590 --> 00:34:36.500
Will you write me the one you like?

00:34:41.080 --> 00:34:42.130
Yes

00:35:05.230 --> 00:35:07.660
Wrong again!

00:35:13.100 --> 00:35:17.430
White is paper. Black - letters on it

00:35:18.570 --> 00:35:22.400
To quote something, I have to know it

00:35:23.750 --> 00:35:29.600
I'll lose my mind so soon

00:35:32.890 --> 00:35:35.140
How can I write an answer?

00:35:35.790 --> 00:35:38.570
What to do now?

00:35:39.300 --> 00:35:41.420
I shouldn't have pretended that I understood this.

00:35:43.030 --> 00:35:44.510
I don't know!

00:36:46.040 --> 00:36:49.000
Stop it! I'm serious!

00:36:54.070 --> 00:36:55.260
Su!

00:36:56.700 --> 00:36:59.520
What brings you here? Have you come to see me?

00:36:59.520 --> 00:37:03.030
No really. I wanted to bring something

00:37:03.030 --> 00:37:04.330
Is this food?

00:37:08.800 --> 00:37:09.930
This is it?

00:37:10.640 --> 00:37:12.840
Yes it is

00:37:20.430 --> 00:37:24.310
I studied a poem with her and told her to write another one

00:37:24.310 --> 00:37:25.800
- You can go
- Yes

00:37:39.500 --> 00:37:40.580
Brother

00:37:42.330 --> 00:37:45.350
Let's see what Hae Soo wrote

00:37:45.810 --> 00:37:46.900
Wait

00:37:58.560 --> 00:38:02.090
What is this? Did she write or draw this?

00:38:02.730 --> 00:38:05.380
Idiots. Give it here

00:38:13.040 --> 00:38:15.500
Brother, do you know what this is?

00:38:25.340 --> 00:38:27.130
Well, that's...

00:38:30.670 --> 00:38:32.410
But isn't this...

00:38:32.410 --> 00:38:37.140
Are they written symbols or drawings?

00:38:37.970 --> 00:38:39.670
You know?

00:38:42.990 --> 00:38:44.200
Maybe you know, brother?

00:38:48.690 --> 00:38:49.820
Raise your hands

00:38:56.330 --> 00:38:57.670
To the sky

00:39:00.420 --> 00:39:01.590
Open your mouth

00:39:03.090 --> 00:39:04.200
Make it rounder

00:39:09.480 --> 00:39:11.430
Yes. This is exactly what

00:39:11.430 --> 00:39:14.110
Brother, this is funny

00:39:15.620 --> 00:39:17.530
He's right. This is it

00:39:17.530 --> 00:39:19.730
- Absolutely the same
- Let me see

00:39:23.570 --> 00:39:26.020
You should watch everything!

00:39:27.020 --> 00:39:28.800
This is the face that laughs in delight

00:39:28.800 --> 00:39:30.580
Ah, a laughing face!

00:39:30.580 --> 00:39:32.950
She probably really liked Uka's poem

00:39:36.220 --> 00:39:37.460
And you try

00:39:39.100 --> 00:39:40.980
And you are brother

00:39:44.030 --> 00:39:45.390
Stop!

00:39:48.660 --> 00:39:50.160
Stop!

00:39:57.230 --> 00:39:58.460
What are you doing?

00:39:58.910 --> 00:39:59.910
What?

00:40:01.060 --> 00:40:02.860
How can you do this to Myung Hee?

00:40:04.000 --> 00:40:05.830
You know what kind of person she is

00:40:07.350 --> 00:40:11.600
You know about her feelings for Wook. How can you do this?

00:40:11.600 --> 00:40:14.140
What have I done that you scold me?

00:40:16.920 --> 00:40:18.400
What have you done?

00:40:20.210 --> 00:40:21.860
You keep exchanging glances with each other

00:40:21.860 --> 00:40:23.910
When your hands accidentally touch,

00:40:23.910 --> 00:40:25.980
you replay this moment in your head for a few more days

00:40:28.250 --> 00:40:30.640
"What kind of food does he like?"

00:40:31.790 --> 00:40:33.600
"What makes him laugh?"

00:40:34.120 --> 00:40:36.220
This is probably all you think about!

00:40:38.900 --> 00:40:41.270
Everything you look at makes you think of him.

00:40:41.990 --> 00:40:44.680
These are the feelings that float between you!

00:40:46.370 --> 00:40:48.040
Did you think no one would notice?

00:40:50.980 --> 00:40:54.680
I know. And Myung Hee knows

00:40:56.200 --> 00:40:59.570
Myung Hee knows everything

00:41:00.480 --> 00:41:01.900
Does he know?

00:41:02.710 --> 00:41:03.840
Listen carefully

00:41:05.790 --> 00:41:07.990
All she has is Uk

00:41:07.990 --> 00:41:10.740
She always looked only at him

00:41:10.740 --> 00:41:14.980
If you... If you hurt her

00:41:18.450 --> 00:41:20.620
I won't sit idly by

00:42:00.960 --> 00:42:03.190
Sorry you had to hear that

00:42:03.190 --> 00:42:04.830
It's my fault

00:42:06.900 --> 00:42:08.840
I promised I wouldn't burden you

00:42:10.350 --> 00:42:12.570
But it became your heaviest burden

00:42:13.690 --> 00:42:15.430
It's not your fault, Su

00:42:18.700 --> 00:42:20.350
It was I who gave you the poem

00:42:21.790 --> 00:42:23.100
And I got yours

00:42:24.700 --> 00:42:27.630
I wanted to make you laugh. It's all me

00:42:28.860 --> 00:42:31.140
When I see you I

00:42:30.020 --> 00:42:31.880
It's all my fault

00:42:32.640 --> 00:42:35.950
I can’t breathe, I’m timid

00:42:35.360 --> 00:42:38.440
Don't blame yourself. Please

00:42:36.140 --> 00:42:39.740
It's as if everything in the world has stopped

00:42:40.850 --> 00:42:43.450
I knew human feelings could be dangerous

00:42:42.040 --> 00:42:46.640
If I pass by like a breeze,

00:42:45.180 --> 00:42:49.300
I pretended not to notice and thought that everything would be resolved

00:42:46.640 --> 00:42:49.740
you won't even notice

00:42:50.440 --> 00:42:55.040
My heart is all given to you

00:42:52.100 --> 00:42:54.070
I took your hand

00:42:56.030 --> 00:42:58.160
And left my room that night

00:42:56.940 --> 00:43:03.040
But loving you is very painful for me

00:42:58.160 --> 00:42:59.800
It's my fault

00:43:03.040 --> 00:43:05.240
And so sad

00:43:05.240 --> 00:43:09.740
I need to cross you out of my heart

00:43:06.800 --> 00:43:08.060
Please

00:43:10.330 --> 00:43:11.510
don't say that

00:43:11.040 --> 00:43:12.640
so hard

00:43:14.840 --> 00:43:18.940
Don't forget, please!

00:43:17.480 --> 00:43:19.920
When I'm with you...

00:43:19.810 --> 00:43:24.240
That eternal love of mine

00:43:21.520 --> 00:43:22.830
I always cry

00:43:31.640 --> 00:43:34.440
You burn with your gaze

00:43:35.240 --> 00:43:38.440
As if you know everything yourself

00:43:35.680 --> 00:43:37.300
Sorry

00:43:39.040 --> 00:43:42.640
About what's on my heart

00:43:44.790 --> 00:43:49.400
Even if I want to, I can’t leave

00:43:49.400 --> 00:43:52.490
Holds the memories

00:43:53.040 --> 00:43:57.340
Even when you and I are not around

00:43:59.540 --> 00:44:05.640
But loving you is very painful for me

00:44:05.640 --> 00:44:07.840
And so sad

00:44:07.840 --> 00:44:12.940
I need to cross you out of my heart

00:44:13.640 --> 00:44:15.240
so hard

00:44:17.440 --> 00:44:21.540
Don't forget, please!

00:44:22.410 --> 00:44:26.840
That eternal love...

00:44:27.860 --> 00:44:29.370
mine

00:44:52.910 --> 00:44:55.830
I thought it was time to change my pillow and did it for you

00:44:56.130 --> 00:44:59.120
I will be the Emperor of Heaven when I sleep on such a decoration

00:44:59.120 --> 00:45:01.500
My skills are still not perfect

00:45:03.100 --> 00:45:05.960
They say fathers become fools around their daughters

00:45:05.960 --> 00:45:07.470
That's exactly who I am

00:45:09.250 --> 00:45:12.940
You are such a beautiful young girl. Who can I marry you to?

00:45:13.540 --> 00:45:16.280
I am confident that you will make the right decision for me, Emperor

00:45:17.790 --> 00:45:21.670
I want you to live happily, just like my eldest daughter

00:45:21.670 --> 00:45:23.850
Unfortunately I rarely see her

00:45:23.880 --> 00:45:27.300
Princess Naklan is now married and very happy, right?

00:45:30.540 --> 00:45:35.460
Are you saying that you want to send me to live away from the palace?

00:45:37.440 --> 00:45:39.720
And what? Don't you want to?

00:45:41.630 --> 00:45:45.710
I will be happy in any place you choose for me

00:45:45.710 --> 00:45:49.220
I will wait until you find me a worthy match, Emperor

00:45:50.390 --> 00:45:53.650
Yong Hwa, how do you manage to always make me happy with your speeches?

00:45:54.740 --> 00:45:58.990
You are the greatest joy for an old man

00:45:58.990 --> 00:46:00.840
Thank you

00:46:19.680 --> 00:46:21.000
Brother

00:46:23.920 --> 00:46:24.960
Yes

00:46:28.270 --> 00:46:31.630
Still not used to seeing you in the palace

00:46:33.330 --> 00:46:35.890
And I still can’t get used to these clothes

00:46:36.910 --> 00:46:38.680
Have you come to see the Emperor?

00:46:38.680 --> 00:46:39.770
Yes

00:46:40.890 --> 00:46:44.830
The Emperor plans to marry me off

00:46:45.640 --> 00:46:49.040
Really? Has he already chosen someone?

00:46:50.540 --> 00:46:51.780
The thing is...

00:46:51.780 --> 00:46:54.540
What? You don't think it will be you, do you?

00:47:00.580 --> 00:47:02.630
Don't cherish vain hopes

00:47:03.290 --> 00:47:07.130
It's amazing that the emperor allowed you to stay and live in the palace

00:47:07.880 --> 00:47:10.890
But he will never give his precious Yong Hwa to someone like you

00:47:11.970 --> 00:47:15.840
Do you want to argue about it and see?

00:47:16.350 --> 00:47:18.840
Only fools argue about such things

00:47:18.840 --> 00:47:20.630
Let's ask Yong Hwa

00:47:20.630 --> 00:47:26.530
Will she want to look at such an ugly face all her life?

00:47:31.140 --> 00:47:33.300
I'm not looking for a handsome man

00:47:33.300 --> 00:47:35.740
I need someone who will treasure me

00:47:36.740 --> 00:47:39.330
Someone for whom I will be a treasure

00:47:39.330 --> 00:47:42.900
He must know your worth in order to value you.

00:47:42.900 --> 00:47:47.210
Yong Hwa, I would value you as an empress

00:47:47.210 --> 00:47:50.110
You've always been so good to me brother

00:47:51.910 --> 00:47:54.050
What about you, brother?

00:47:56.610 --> 00:48:00.050
You're not asking me to evaluate you, are you?

00:48:00.790 --> 00:48:04.530
I would prefer a woman with high self-esteem to someone who values me.

00:48:06.980 --> 00:48:10.170
The one who won't be embarrassed by my ugly face

00:48:19.770 --> 00:48:21.050
It's just words

00:48:21.860 --> 00:48:24.130
He always acts like this

00:48:24.130 --> 00:48:26.570
He's still just an animal

00:48:28.630 --> 00:48:32.110
How fun must it be to transform an animal into a human?

00:48:33.470 --> 00:48:35.550
Sometimes I'm very curious about it

00:49:42.830 --> 00:49:44.120
Sister!

00:49:46.110 --> 00:49:48.910
Sister, is everything okay?

00:49:56.940 --> 00:50:00.010
Chae Ryong! Chae Ryong! Chae Ryong!

00:50:00.010 --> 00:50:02.600
Is there anyone? Chae Ryong!

00:50:02.600 --> 00:50:03.790
Su!

00:50:04.680 --> 00:50:05.780
You

00:50:06.810 --> 00:50:10.280
What are your feelings for the prince?

00:50:22.240 --> 00:50:23.810
You're so stupid

00:50:26.080 --> 00:50:30.130
You're both so stupid

00:50:36.340 --> 00:50:37.570
You can

00:50:40.600 --> 00:50:42.420
put makeup on me?

00:50:44.220 --> 00:50:45.260
What?

00:50:47.040 --> 00:50:48.810
For him

00:50:51.470 --> 00:50:55.530
I want him to remember me as beautiful

00:50:59.270 --> 00:51:00.810
Sister

00:51:48.810 --> 00:51:50.020
Su

00:51:51.530 --> 00:51:54.560
You can easily catch a cold

00:51:55.560 --> 00:51:58.440
Always remember to drink honey and ginger

00:52:01.230 --> 00:52:03.370
You live so close to the imperial family

00:52:04.690 --> 00:52:07.850
Always be careful with your words and actions

00:52:10.210 --> 00:52:14.140
I'm always worried about your temper

00:52:17.390 --> 00:52:19.240
About the prince...

00:52:23.270 --> 00:52:27.480
I want you to make a pillow for him

00:52:29.540 --> 00:52:31.690
He has enough worries

00:52:32.260 --> 00:52:35.830
I would like him to be comfortable in his sleep

00:52:40.730 --> 00:52:41.990
I ask you...

00:52:44.320 --> 00:52:45.990
take care of him

00:53:30.090 --> 00:53:32.410
Prince! Prince!

00:53:36.050 --> 00:53:38.170
- Su
- Sister

00:53:38.760 --> 00:53:42.640
She's looking for you. Faster

00:53:59.440 --> 00:54:03.450
Wife, I think we should go back inside.

00:54:05.880 --> 00:54:07.630
I wanted to take a walk with you

00:54:08.870 --> 00:54:13.530
I wanted us to admire the snow

00:54:16.140 --> 00:54:17.880
Do you remember?

00:54:20.790 --> 00:54:24.110
Remember when I first saw you?

00:54:47.460 --> 00:54:50.400
I knew you thought that I would be a burden to you

00:54:50.990 --> 00:54:53.460
And still insisted on the wedding

00:54:54.940 --> 00:54:57.050
You were kicked out of the palace

00:54:57.780 --> 00:55:00.510
You were the prince whose wings were clipped

00:55:01.440 --> 00:55:05.520
I wanted to help you get up

00:55:12.930 --> 00:55:13.930
wife

00:55:18.550 --> 00:55:21.510
Why did you think I didn't know how you felt?

00:56:00.290 --> 00:56:01.780
Now...

00:56:03.110 --> 00:56:05.760
I want you, prince,

00:56:07.170 --> 00:56:09.410
looked after Hae Soo

00:56:12.450 --> 00:56:17.280
Think about my feelings for you

00:56:18.660 --> 00:56:19.910
Please Su...

00:56:21.700 --> 00:56:23.000
This child...

00:56:27.310 --> 00:56:30.290
Wife? wife

00:56:52.280 --> 00:56:53.640
wife

00:56:55.990 --> 00:56:57.860
What you told me

00:57:00.110 --> 00:57:01.700
I will never forget

00:57:04.870 --> 00:57:06.130
You said

00:57:09.040 --> 00:57:11.530
that I don't love you

00:57:16.460 --> 00:57:19.770
Madam, I...

00:57:19.770 --> 00:57:21.420
You...

00:57:23.400 --> 00:57:25.690
don't have to say anything

00:57:30.130 --> 00:57:31.140
But...

00:57:33.210 --> 00:57:35.460
I was happy

00:57:38.240 --> 00:57:40.110
love you more

00:57:43.220 --> 00:57:45.240
That was enough

00:58:06.620 --> 00:58:07.660
Sister

00:58:34.770 --> 00:58:36.890
Don't wake her up from her sleep

00:59:32.960 --> 00:59:39.660
Thanks for watching with us!
Release group MANIA

00:59:32.960 --> 00:59:39.660
http://doramamania.mybb.ru
http://vk.com/doramamania

00:59:39.960 --> 00:59:42.660
Scarlet Hearts: Ryeo

00:59:49.060 --> 00:59:55.660
Another place and another time here, but I believe, you are my love

00:59:55.660 --> 01:00:01.560
A fair wind will bring your scent, it’s so easy for me to recognize it

01:00:01.760 --> 01:00:04.560
But I don't understand

01:00:04.560 --> 01:00:08.460
When did you settle in my heart, tell me

01:00:08.460 --> 01:00:10.960
I don't understand

01:00:10.960 --> 01:00:13.960
Why is my heart beating fast?

01:00:13.960 --> 01:00:19.760
You may suddenly pass by and not notice, have you forgotten me?
